==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] (150%) spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 8~13.33 seconds<sup>240f~400f</sup>.
**100 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (200%) spawns.
**2 [[Bears Be Bare]]s (200%) spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] with meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] can help deal with the Dark Enemies. Other than that, Using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can help deal with them. If bahamut is not owned, you can use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]].

